{! Included after each rule that throws, with the same CLASS and METHOD: on the way out of the method, the frames
   of the agent that ran the rule are taken off the exception, so that its stack trace starts at the method, as
   that of the real failure does. !}
RULE {fault} {of}: hide the frames of the agent
CLASS {type}
METHOD {method}
AT EXCEPTION EXIT
IF true
DO io.quarkiverse.resiliencytesting.runtime.internal.jvm.InjectedFrames.hide($^)
ENDRULE
